econd%20jabbed%20at,a%20rusty%2C%20ancient%2Dlooking%20sword.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Episode 2: Awaken the Trolls","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Roy Graham","Jenna Helland"],"date":"2021-01-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-awaken-trolls-2021-01-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-awaken-trolls-2021-01-13#:~:text=The%20second%20jabbed%20at,a%20rusty%2C%20ancient%2Dlooking%20sword.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 2: Awaken the Trolls\" by Roy Graham, Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"episode-2-awaken-trolls-2021-01-13-e6","era":null,"summary":"Kaya chases Tibalt and corners him; he says chaos is its own reward and denies knowledge of the monster.","participants":["kaya","tibalt"],"location":"gnottvold","importance":"minor","page":"stories/episode-2-awaken-trolls-2021-01-13","order":717,"story_date":"2021-01-13","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":39,"quote":"Chaos is its own reward, and nothing puts a smile on my face like a bit of mayhem.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-awaken-trolls-2021-01-13#:~:text=Chaos%20is%20its%20own,a%20bit%20of%20mayhem.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Episode 2: Awaken the Trolls","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Roy Graham","Jenna Helland"],"date":"2021-01-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-awaken-trolls-2021-01-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-awaken-trolls-2021-01-13#:~:text=Chaos%20is%20its%20own,a%20bit%20of%20mayhem.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 2: Awaken the Trolls\" by Roy Graham, Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"episode-2-awaken-trolls-2021-01-13-e7","era":null,"summary":"Tibalt whistles and wakes six T